 grouped into three regions &#x02013; the North region (Irbid, Jarash, Ajloun, and Mafraq), the Central region (Amman, Zarqa, Balqa, and Madaba), and the South region (Karak, Tafielah, Ma'an, and Aqaba).</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap position="float" id="T2"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Odds ratio (OR) estimates of effects of passive smoking status and other selected characteristics on anemia among children aged 0&#x02013;35 months, Jordan 2002</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><td></td><td align="center" colspan="4"><bold>Odd Ratio (Significant Levels)</bold></td></tr><tr><td align="left"><bold>Characteristic</bold></td><td align="left"><bold>Model 1</bold></td><td align="left"><bold>Model 2</bold></td><td align="left"><bold>Model 3</bold></td><td align="left"><bold>Model 4</bold></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left"><bold>Passive smoking status</bold></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;None of parents smoke<sup>&#x02020;</sup></td><td align="left">1.00</td><td align="left">1.00</td><td align="left">1.00</td><td align="left">1.00</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;One of parents smoke</td><td align="left">0.86</td><td align="left">0.84</td><td align="left">0.87</td><td align="left">0.83</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Both parents smoke</td><td align="left">3.08***</td><td align="left">3.14***</td><td align="left">3.00***</td><td align="left">2.99***</td></tr><tr><td align="left"><bold>Child's age (months)</bold></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;0&#x02013;11<sup>&#x02020;</sup></td><td></td><td align="left">1.00</td><td align="left">1.00</td><td align="left">1.00</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;12&#x02013;23</td><td></td><td align="left">0.61</td><td align="left">0.64</td><td align="left">0.63</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;24&#x02013;35</td><td></td><td align="left">0.34***</td><td align="left">0.37**</